  "design": {
    "idea": "Lens-Grinder's Loft: defeat the coastal ambush around the live Lighthouse beam, then push the movable Blue Transformer into the vertical beam at (248, 136) and angle it 225 deg to bounce a steady blue ray west into the crystal conduit \u2014 shattering the dome over Upper Nave's Boss Key and opening Cycle 5 to r9!",
    "kind": "combat",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Redirecting a live Lighthouse Beam through a pushed Blue Transformer into a blue Beam Sensor mid-loft.",
    "decisions": 9,
    "expert_s": 50,
    "reward": "lh_flame_unshielded+cycle_5_to_r9",
    "why": "Penultimate upper-loft fight synthesizing combat and beam redirection before the Upper Prism Nave.",
